      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If a code is available within 24 hours, the process will end."
      ],
      "reason": "Action elements invent a \"(train)\" qualifier not present in source, artificially scoping the global condition. The guard abstracts the condition to v2='Available' but silently drops the mandatory \"within 24 hours\" temporal constraint."
